  "description": "*“Sleep with me. Just this once?”* \n\nSe-In had an impulsive one-night stand with Shin Tae-heon, the department chief who's been her boss for the last three years.\n\nHe went away for an overseas work trip afterwards, but he started acting strangely when he got back.\n\n*\"Am I the only one who can't forget that night?\"*\n\nJust once isn't enough.\n\n*\"Yun Se-In is the one I want.\"* \n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
